1
00:00:00,982 --> 00:00:05,352
(Sheldon:)I know Mr. Data isn't supposed
to smile, but here it comes.

2
00:00:09,357 --> 00:00:11,287
(Howard(dressed as a Borg):)Come on, guys, let's do this.

3
00:00:11,493 --> 00:00:13,723
(Leonard(dressed as Captain Picard):)Yeah, I'm sweating my bald cap off.

4
00:00:19,167 --> 00:00:20,637
What's our first pose gonna be?

5
00:00:20,869 --> 00:00:23,359
(Raj:)I say we begin with a classic
Star Trek fight scene.

6
00:00:23,571 --> 00:00:25,161
(Leonard:)I'll set the timer.

7
00:00:31,179 --> 00:00:33,149
(Howard:)Sheldon, how is that a fight pose?

8
00:00:33,381 --> 00:00:35,941
(Sheldon:)Mr. Data's weapon is his mind.

9
00:00:36,150 --> 00:00:37,240
(Sheldon:)I'm wielding it.

10
00:00:45,260 --> 00:00:47,090
(Raj:)Phasers on the Borg!

11
00:00:50,164 --> 00:00:55,024
Charlie's Angels!

